1
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:14,806
CHALLENGE LETTER

2
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:18,977
Ranma,

3
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,439
of the Saotome School of Anything Goes
Martial Arts. Akane of the Tendo Dojo.

4
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:26,776
These two were arranged
to be married by their parents.

5
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:28,987
Don't tell me what to do!

6
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:30,613
You're so annoying!

7
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:34,159
However, Ranma has a small problem.

8
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,453
What was that for?!

9
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:40,415
Whenever he's splashed with cold water,
Ranma transforms into a girl.

10
00:00:44,252 --> 00:00:50,050
{\an8}RANMA1/2

11
00:01:04,856 --> 00:01:07,525
{\an8}RANMA

12
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:10,862
AKANE

13
00:02:12,715 --> 00:02:17,095
{\an8}TSUBASA KURENAI BUSTS LOOSE!

14
00:02:20,974 --> 00:02:26,271
"I shall come take your life in the
near future." "Tsubasa Kurenai"...?

15
00:02:26,813 --> 00:02:28,398
Is it another challenge letter?

16
00:02:32,443 --> 00:02:34,988
Do I know anyone named Tsubasa Kurenai?

17
00:02:35,822 --> 00:02:36,656
What did you do?

18
00:02:36,739 --> 00:02:38,783
Did you steal? Dine and dash?
A marriage scam?

19
00:02:38,867 --> 00:02:40,034
STEAL, DINE AND DASH, MARRIAGE SCAM

20
00:02:40,118 --> 00:02:40,994
- Give me a break.
- Prepare yourself, Ranma Saotome!

21
00:02:41,077 --> 00:02:42,662
- Huh?
- Huh?

22
00:02:42,745 --> 00:02:43,830
- Huh?
- Huh?

23
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:55,508
Is that a...

24
00:02:56,009 --> 00:02:56,926
Mail box?

25
00:03:02,682 --> 00:03:05,185
And now I charge!

26
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:11,774
Hey, you got the wrong address!

27
00:03:11,858 --> 00:03:14,652
Ranma,
what did you do to annoy that mailbox?

28
00:03:14,736 --> 00:03:17,030
I don't remember annoying any mailboxes!

29
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:20,575
And now I charge!

30
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:36,424
Huh?

31
00:03:41,679 --> 00:03:42,513
Eh?

32
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:51,731
A woman?!

33
00:03:53,733 --> 00:03:55,276
Ran... ma...

34
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:02,200
And now... I charge...

35
00:04:03,826 --> 00:04:04,702
SWAY

36
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,581
Who is she?

37
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:19,467
- Somewhere?
- Hey you two, what's going on here?

38
00:04:19,968 --> 00:04:21,177
Ukyo...

39
00:04:21,803 --> 00:04:22,637
Huh?

40
00:04:23,429 --> 00:04:25,348
Ukyo is that you?

41
00:04:27,183 --> 00:04:29,102
Tsubasa... Kurenai?!

42
00:04:32,313 --> 00:04:35,024
Huh? That's the one
who sent the challenge letter?

43
00:04:35,108 --> 00:04:36,609
Wait, you know this person?

44
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:39,279
- Huh?
- Throw it away! Throw it away!

45
00:04:39,362 --> 00:04:40,196
Whoa!

46
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:41,906
- Yay!
- Get away from us!

47
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:42,824
Wow!

48
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:46,536
Damnit. I can't believe she
followed me all the way here.

49
00:04:46,619 --> 00:04:48,162
So what's her deal then?

50
00:04:50,164 --> 00:04:52,959
Tsubasa was one of my
classmates at my previous school.

51
00:04:53,459 --> 00:04:54,711
She was?

52
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:56,713
But why is she trying to a fight me?

53
00:04:56,796 --> 00:05:00,842
Well, don't forget I was living as a man
until I came here. Because of that...

54
00:05:01,926 --> 00:05:04,429
Hey, Ukyo! Here!

55
00:05:04,512 --> 00:05:11,477
Tsubasa... I'm flattered that you like me,
but... I have... a fiancee! Got it!?

56
00:05:12,812 --> 00:05:19,485
But I have... a fiancee! Got it!?
Got it?! Got it?! Got it?!

57
00:05:22,363 --> 00:05:26,117
Even so, I never ever gave up on love!
Even after Ukyo transferred schools,

58
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:31,831
I would write love letters. Love letter
after love letter after love letter!

59
00:05:31,914 --> 00:05:34,334
Like I said, she was being so annoying.

60
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:38,504
I sent a letter to break it off with her,
along with a photo of Ranma.

61
00:05:39,005 --> 00:05:41,174
Sad, sad, sad, sad, sad.

62
00:05:42,008 --> 00:05:43,843
Which Ranma did you send a photo of?

63
00:05:43,926 --> 00:05:45,720
The female one, obviously.

64
00:05:45,803 --> 00:05:46,763
Okay, but why?

65
00:05:46,846 --> 00:05:48,806
Because Tsubasa still
thinks that I'm a guy.

66
00:05:48,890 --> 00:05:51,642
Things might get complicated
if my fiancée was one too.

67
00:05:57,607 --> 00:05:58,441
What is it?

68
00:05:59,525 --> 00:06:02,820
- Ugly!
- Ug... ly?!

69
00:06:04,322 --> 00:06:08,034
Hold on, Ranma...
Did that really hurt your feelings?

70
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:15,666
Ukyo!! I wonder who lost
that so-called ugly girl?

71
00:06:18,461 --> 00:06:19,921
Well yeah, that's how it is...

72
00:06:20,004 --> 00:06:21,964
So pack it up and go home.

73
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:23,591
Just wait and see!

74
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:27,553
That was kind of a lot.

75
00:06:27,637 --> 00:06:30,056
Nah, she learned her lesson.
It was enough.

76
00:06:30,556 --> 00:06:31,599
Hmm?

77
00:06:31,682 --> 00:06:34,727
And now I charge!

78
00:06:42,777 --> 00:06:44,153
Damn. I missed.

79
00:06:44,904 --> 00:06:50,952
{\an8}Tsubasa... I'm gonna grill you up!

80
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:54,872
{\an8}Hey! Look, Tsubasa!

81
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,251
What are you doing?!

82
00:06:59,293 --> 00:07:04,298
Don't you get it?
Ukyo is a woman. She's a... Woman...

83
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:07,885
PROBLEM SOLVED

84
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:10,763
Don't you think you should've
led with that in the first place?

85
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:11,681
You're right!

86
00:07:11,764 --> 00:07:16,436
You're saying that Ukyo is actually a
woman? I've known she is from the start.

87
00:07:18,062 --> 00:07:20,189
Listen close.
What you don't know is' I've

88
00:07:20,273 --> 00:07:25,736
only ever been interested in girls!
I'm going to steal Ukyo no matter what!

89
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:30,575
Ugly!

90
00:07:30,658 --> 00:07:33,286
PROBLEM NOT SOLVED

91
00:07:33,369 --> 00:07:36,706
- So Tsubasa is actually into girls then?
- This might take a while.

92
00:07:36,789 --> 00:07:40,042
Ugly?!

93
00:07:42,795 --> 00:07:44,547
- Morning!
- Morning.

94
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:47,758
- Huh?
- And now I charge!

95
00:07:50,011 --> 00:07:52,388
Ukyo! Why're you so mean?!

96
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,558
Whoa, she's cute!

97
00:07:56,058 --> 00:07:59,020
I've told you once already,
stop following me, Tsubasa.

98
00:08:00,104 --> 00:08:02,148
- Whoa!
- It's Tsubasa Kurenai...

99
00:08:02,231 --> 00:08:05,902
Don't you get it? I already have a
fiancee and his name is Ranma.

100
00:08:05,985 --> 00:08:09,113
Who? That ugly girl?!
No way she's your fiancee!

101
00:08:09,614 --> 00:08:11,782
Yes way! Ranma is a man.

102
00:08:12,575 --> 00:08:14,160
Hey, Tsubasa. Whatcha doing?

103
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:16,245
Oh, there you are, ugly!

104
00:08:16,329 --> 00:08:17,914
I know you are, but why am I?

105
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:21,751
Alright,

106
00:08:21,834 --> 00:08:25,463
that's it. We're going to see which
one of us is more suitable for Ukyo.

107
00:08:26,255 --> 00:08:29,300
- Hey, what's this?
- Uuh... During lunch...

108
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:30,635
An Okonomiyaki stall?!

109
00:08:30,718 --> 00:08:33,095
A pop-up stand? What is all this?!

110
00:08:33,179 --> 00:08:35,181
LUNCHTIME OKONOMIYAKI FOOD STALL
UCCHAN POP-UP STAND

111
00:08:36,432 --> 00:08:37,934
{\an8}Duh. Of course I am.

112
00:08:38,643 --> 00:08:42,897
How dare you advertise without asking!
We're going to make a killing!

113
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,982
I'm just glad I could be of some help!

114
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:49,195
All right! It's lunchtime!!

115
00:08:49,695 --> 00:08:53,324
{\an8}And we're all back again! It's the
Furinkan High School Broadcast Club!

116
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:56,619
{\an8}And this one's a doozy so pay close
attention! A sudden event is

117
00:08:56,702 --> 00:09:01,123
being held at Furinkan High School.
A battle to steal hearts and stomachs!

118
00:09:01,207 --> 00:09:03,876
{\an8}It's an okonomiyaki showdown in
Ucchan's pop-up stand!

119
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:07,547
{\an8}You'll be hearing live commentary from
the Broadcast Club, brought to you by

120
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:11,175
{\an8}your very own Ichiro! Fighting for
Ukyo Kuonji's heart and the title of her

121
00:09:11,259 --> 00:09:12,843
lover are these two contenders!

122
00:09:13,636 --> 00:09:17,515
It's the troublemaker we know and love.
Furinkan High School's, Ranma Saotome!

123
00:09:17,598 --> 00:09:19,267
You better not cry when you lose.

124
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:23,688
She's up against the charging monster of
love and persistence, Tsubasa Kurenai!

125
00:09:24,188 --> 00:09:26,315
You're the one who's gonna lose, ugly!

126
00:09:27,733 --> 00:09:30,152
The rules are simple!
Victory will be awarded to

127
00:09:30,236 --> 00:09:33,823
whoever sells the most Okonomiyaki!
Their passion has reached its peak!

128
00:09:33,906 --> 00:09:37,243
Alright, everybody, here we go!
Ukyo Kuonji, the owner of the iron

129
00:09:37,326 --> 00:09:43,249
plate and who sparked this fight
is about to kick things off!

130
00:09:43,332 --> 00:09:47,378
The Furinkan High School Ucchan
pop-up stand is now open for business!

131
00:09:48,254 --> 00:09:49,130
No way I'll lose.

132
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,215
And now I charge!

133
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:56,846
{\an8}I heard that Tsubasa girl is
only interested in other girls.

134
00:09:56,929 --> 00:09:59,056
Oh right, so that's why she likes Ukyo?

135
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:00,391
- Ranma...
- Apparently so.

136
00:10:00,474 --> 00:10:02,935
- Oh I see...
- Why are you taking this so seriously?

137
00:10:03,019 --> 00:10:04,729
Heh. My beauty is gonna
sell a buttload of these.

138
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:06,689
No way she'll call me ugly ever again!

139
00:10:06,772 --> 00:10:10,985
Lunch break is the battlefield! The men,
who are lured by the aroma of the sauce,

140
00:10:11,068 --> 00:10:13,988
are now swarming for love and
that floury goodness!

141
00:10:14,697 --> 00:10:15,990
- Gimmie some Okonomiyaki!
- I want one too!

142
00:10:16,073 --> 00:10:17,700
- I need it now!
- Hey!

143
00:10:17,783 --> 00:10:20,453
Make sure you buy from
whoever you think is the cutest!

144
00:10:20,536 --> 00:10:23,331
And look at that! A collision
of pride fueled by passion and love!

145
00:10:23,414 --> 00:10:26,250
But the question is,
who will be victorious in the end?!

146
00:10:36,302 --> 00:10:37,136
And there it is!

147
00:10:37,219 --> 00:10:41,182
A flawless victory for Tsubasa Kurenai!
She is a shockingly an instant sellout!

148
00:10:41,265 --> 00:10:45,686
{\an8}Compared to her, Ranma Saotome's
sales are at an embarrassing zero!

149
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:47,521
{\an8}It... it can't be...

150
00:10:47,605 --> 00:10:51,192
Oh, it looks like I win! Ugly!
So that means Ukyo belongs to me now!

151
00:10:51,275 --> 00:10:53,611
That's what you get!

152
00:10:54,111 --> 00:10:56,864
Tsubasa are you available for
a quick interview?

153
00:10:57,573 --> 00:11:02,286
I was so confident that I would win...
Does that mean I'm actually ugly?

154
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:04,705
What are you talking about? You're super

155
00:11:04,789 --> 00:11:07,833
- cute. Yes! It's true, Pig-tailed girl!
- Get away from me!

156
00:11:07,917 --> 00:11:10,586
BOOM

157
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:13,756
So the only one who doesn't
know you who you really are...

158
00:11:13,839 --> 00:11:16,008
Happens to be Kuno,
sure that makes sense.

159
00:11:16,092 --> 00:11:16,926
Oh!

160
00:11:17,009 --> 00:11:19,929
Yep. Ranma, you can't compete with a
real girl on these school grounds,

161
00:11:20,012 --> 00:11:21,138
what are you thinking?

162
00:11:23,099 --> 00:11:27,478
This fight's just begun. Just you wait!

163
00:11:31,816 --> 00:11:33,693
Come and get it! Delicious Okonomiyaki!

164
00:11:33,776 --> 00:11:36,862
- First come, first serve!
- Oh wow check her out! She's so cute!

165
00:11:36,946 --> 00:11:38,531
- A bunny girl?!
- Who is she?

166
00:11:38,614 --> 00:11:39,532
- Wow!
- Gimmie one!

167
00:11:39,615 --> 00:11:40,950
- I want one too!
- I want one!

168
00:11:41,033 --> 00:11:42,993
Wow! Thank you so much!

169
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:44,453
SALES

170
00:11:44,537 --> 00:11:45,371
Oh, please!

171
00:11:45,454 --> 00:11:49,333
This is the perfect disguise.
Nobody will know it's actually me.

172
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:52,086
- I'll buy two of them!
- Oh boys.

173
00:11:52,169 --> 00:11:53,796
- I'll take three!
- One at a time

174
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:55,256
I'll buy ten as long as
you go on a date with me!

175
00:11:55,339 --> 00:11:57,258
I'm so happy!

176
00:11:59,385 --> 00:12:02,596
What are you doing?! I was one
Okonomiyaki away from selling out!

177
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,348
You're coming with me, right now!

178
00:12:05,433 --> 00:12:06,976
RANMA

179
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:11,313
So tell me, why are you so happy
being popular with the boys?

180
00:12:11,397 --> 00:12:17,319
Ugh Because... this is a competition!
Hey! Does anybody wanna buy one more!?

181
00:12:17,403 --> 00:12:18,529
Cut it out!

182
00:12:19,655 --> 00:12:21,574
So it looks like I win after all, huh?

183
00:12:21,657 --> 00:12:24,910
- A tree?
- Now I get to say Ukyo is all mine...

184
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:26,036
Wait a minute!

185
00:12:32,877 --> 00:12:35,588
If that's your last one,
then I'll buy it.

186
00:12:37,506 --> 00:12:39,759
- Ukyo...
- Ukyo, how could you?

187
00:12:40,843 --> 00:12:42,970
I guess this means you two are even now.

188
00:12:43,053 --> 00:12:46,098
Oh... That's not fair, I was gonna win.

189
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,478
I guess, if you really didn't
wanna go out with me that badly...

190
00:12:50,561 --> 00:12:55,024
Then you should have just come out
and told me so in the first place!

191
00:12:55,107 --> 00:12:57,777
I've been telling you that
right from the very start!

192
00:12:58,569 --> 00:12:59,403
I get it.

193
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:04,784
Ok, I'll step aside. I'll totally
let go of my feelings I have for you.

194
00:13:10,164 --> 00:13:11,040
Goodbye!

195
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,083
Tsubasa...

196
00:13:16,253 --> 00:13:18,005
- Ranma?
- Where're you going?

197
00:13:25,846 --> 00:13:28,766
PARK

198
00:13:30,810 --> 00:13:31,644
Tsubasa...

199
00:13:33,437 --> 00:13:36,607
You know what? I hate to say it,
but you were the winner.

200
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,652
You're not ugly. I lied.

201
00:13:41,195 --> 00:13:44,073
In fact, you're really cute.
So that's why I bullied you.

202
00:13:44,156 --> 00:13:48,369
Sorry. I'm a bad person.

203
00:13:49,829 --> 00:13:52,206
It's no wonder that Ukyo doesn't like me.

204
00:13:53,249 --> 00:13:55,668
No, I don't think that's the reason.

205
00:13:57,086 --> 00:13:57,920
Anyway,

206
00:13:58,003 --> 00:14:01,841
don't sweat it, I think you're cute.
I'm sure you'll meet someone very soon.

207
00:14:04,426 --> 00:14:06,971
Why're you looking at
me all googly-eyed for?

208
00:14:07,054 --> 00:14:14,019
Here's to a brand new love... And now I
charge! Charge! Charge! Charge!!

209
00:14:15,354 --> 00:14:17,898
She sure does bounce back quickly,
doesn't she?

210
00:14:17,982 --> 00:14:21,193
So I guess any girl will do?
Although, I've got a feeling she'll

211
00:14:21,277 --> 00:14:24,738
be hurt once she finds out
Ranma's true identity.

212
00:14:25,239 --> 00:14:28,450
No matter what happens,
someone's gonna get hurt, for sure...

213
00:14:35,583 --> 00:14:37,334
Why is she running barefoot?

214
00:14:37,418 --> 00:14:41,046
Why? What?! Why?!

215
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:45,634
And... now... I... charge!

216
00:14:45,718 --> 00:14:48,846
Stay away!

217
00:14:54,268 --> 00:14:55,102
THUD

218
00:14:58,898 --> 00:14:59,940
HUP

219
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:01,984
She got away from me again...

220
00:15:04,069 --> 00:15:05,446
{\an8}Even though I love Ranma so much...

221
00:15:05,529 --> 00:15:10,659
Just what is it about me
that she doesn't like?!

222
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:14,038
Well by the looks of things
I'd say there's quite a lot.

223
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:15,706
Oh, Tsubasa...

224
00:15:19,335 --> 00:15:20,961
Oh man, what is it with her?

225
00:15:21,462 --> 00:15:23,797
Once she's in love,
Tsubasa is very persistent.

226
00:15:23,881 --> 00:15:24,882
Ukyo...

227
00:15:25,382 --> 00:15:28,218
Just don't be shy.
A few hits will sort her out.

228
00:15:28,969 --> 00:15:31,805
She's probably right, but
there's no way I can hit a girl.

229
00:15:31,889 --> 00:15:33,724
There has to be a way out of this.

230
00:15:34,767 --> 00:15:37,519
Hey. You should stop wasting your time
on an idiot like Ranma. Why don't

231
00:15:37,603 --> 00:15:40,272
you focus on trying to find someone new.
Yeah I mean there are a whole

232
00:15:40,356 --> 00:15:45,110
bunch of guys at my school who
think you're totally cute Tsubasa!

233
00:15:45,194 --> 00:15:47,154
No way! I absolutely hate guys!

234
00:15:47,237 --> 00:15:49,740
Well, either way,
you should give up on Ranma.

235
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:51,158
But why?

236
00:15:51,909 --> 00:15:52,826
Oh, well, because...

237
00:15:54,787 --> 00:15:59,166
Wait, don't tell me. Is it because...
you like Ranma yourself!?

238
00:15:59,833 --> 00:16:02,002
What?! Who would like a guy like him?!

239
00:16:02,086 --> 00:16:04,838
I thought so.
You scared me for a moment there.

240
00:16:04,922 --> 00:16:07,216
Look, I'm just worried about you, okay?

241
00:16:08,676 --> 00:16:09,510
Huh?!

242
00:16:18,268 --> 00:16:20,688
Oh, Akane... you're so kind!

243
00:16:21,355 --> 00:16:23,565
- Okay, let go...
- Never!

244
00:16:23,649 --> 00:16:26,360
- It's enough! A message?
- Oh.

245
00:16:27,528 --> 00:16:28,654
To my beloved Tsubasa.

246
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:32,616
{\an8}I'll be waiting for you at the
park on Sunday. From Ranma.

247
00:16:33,117 --> 00:16:35,035
Yes!

248
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:48,382
Ranma asked her out?

249
00:16:48,465 --> 00:16:52,011
That's right.
He asked Tsubasa out on a real life date.

250
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:55,055
- Don't tell me that Ranma has actually
- La, la, la. Ranma la la la.

251
00:16:55,139 --> 00:16:57,474
- Started to have feelings for her?
- Hurry up Ranma! La la la!

252
00:16:57,558 --> 00:16:59,435
- No way...
- Tsu-ba-sa!

253
00:16:59,935 --> 00:17:01,353
Oh, Ranma!

254
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:07,818
Your partner today is...
none other than me!

255
00:17:08,652 --> 00:17:09,486
Huh?

256
00:17:11,697 --> 00:17:15,325
Now. Whaddya you say we charge
into the ring of true love together!

257
00:17:17,995 --> 00:17:21,248
- Huh?!
- Does Ranma have a fever or something?

258
00:17:21,749 --> 00:17:23,042
Who are you supposed to be?

259
00:17:23,125 --> 00:17:26,420
Hah. I'm a replacement of that girl and a
practice partner of love. A newcomer. The

260
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:32,217
harmony of two people in love. Now lets
ring the gong of our souls and-- Gong...

261
00:17:32,718 --> 00:17:35,637
So where did you learn to
say such cheesey things, huh?!

262
00:17:35,721 --> 00:17:37,139
Akane, what the hell?!

263
00:17:37,222 --> 00:17:39,558
So it wasn't a date between
two girls after all?

264
00:17:39,641 --> 00:17:42,811
Are you kidding? I'm just trying to get
Tsubasa to see the good side of guys!

265
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:44,646
Yeah? And then what do you plan to do?

266
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:46,815
Hey, she was hitting on you too,
you know!

267
00:17:46,899 --> 00:17:48,275
Oh hey! Wait up!

268
00:17:48,358 --> 00:17:49,735
STRIDE STRIDE STRIDE STRIDE

269
00:17:49,818 --> 00:17:51,403
Look, just don't get in my way!

270
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:54,406
Now, whaddya say you and link pinkies?

271
00:17:54,907 --> 00:17:56,283
Are you out of your mind?

272
00:17:56,784 --> 00:17:59,953
Of course not! Our deeply romantic
escape has only just begun!

273
00:18:00,037 --> 00:18:01,872
You're too persistent, leave me alone.

274
00:18:01,955 --> 00:18:05,918
My heart is racing with excitement
for us. Where shall we go first?

275
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:08,420
Stop following.
Stop talking. Stop breathing!

276
00:18:08,504 --> 00:18:14,510
Somebody stop them! You annoying thieves!

277
00:18:18,013 --> 00:18:18,847
Huh?!

278
00:18:20,724 --> 00:18:22,935
Cats!?

279
00:18:30,609 --> 00:18:32,611
- Ranma!
- Wait!

280
00:18:33,237 --> 00:18:36,824
Hey buddy, do you really think I'm into
hugging guys or something, huh?

281
00:18:36,907 --> 00:18:39,618
I've never... been into...
that kind of thing!

282
00:18:39,701 --> 00:18:46,333
And I never will be,
do you get it, sucker face?!

283
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:50,629
Oh... yeah... sure... my bad... huh... hi... bye!

284
00:18:55,843 --> 00:18:57,594
{\an8}She really hates guys, doesn't she?

285
00:18:58,220 --> 00:18:59,638
That totally serves you right.

286
00:18:59,721 --> 00:19:02,141
As if a guy could think he
can lay a hand on me!

287
00:19:05,561 --> 00:19:07,312
- Ranma is that you?!
- Hey...

288
00:19:08,772 --> 00:19:10,566
Oh, Ranma. Who did this to you?!

289
00:19:10,649 --> 00:19:12,484
Want us to tell you who did it?

290
00:19:13,193 --> 00:19:15,863
- Let's go get you some help!
- I can't go on...

291
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:18,574
No, Ranma! Don't give up on me!

292
00:19:18,657 --> 00:19:22,452
My only wish is that...
I could take a bath one last time.

293
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,955
A bath, you say? You got it!

294
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:26,498
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO

295
00:19:30,669 --> 00:19:33,380
There's something so nice
about having a daytime bath...

296
00:19:37,634 --> 00:19:38,552
As you requested!

297
00:19:47,811 --> 00:19:49,563
Hey Ranma. Are you feeling better?

298
00:19:50,731 --> 00:19:51,565
Hello there...

299
00:19:54,776 --> 00:19:56,570
It's... that guy from earlier!?

300
00:19:57,070 --> 00:19:59,615
So... this is the situation.

301
00:20:00,908 --> 00:20:04,995
No way. So Ranma was, a guy all along?

302
00:20:08,415 --> 00:20:11,585
Akane's been the one and only true
love for me this whole time!

303
00:20:12,961 --> 00:20:14,713
And now I charge!

304
00:20:14,796 --> 00:20:16,673
Not yet!
You keep chasing one girl after another.

305
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:18,634
Just tell me why do you
hate guys so much, huh?!

306
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:19,968
Let me go!

307
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,721
Shut up, pig!

308
00:20:25,474 --> 00:20:28,352
There's no way in hell I'd ever
get involved with a guy!?

309
00:20:28,435 --> 00:20:31,146
All I've ever wanted to
do is date a cute girl!

310
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:33,774
Oh... I see...

311
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:36,944
Does it bother you
seeing another guy in his underwear?

312
00:20:37,027 --> 00:20:41,990
Huh... so you're telling me...
I did all of those things...

313
00:20:42,074 --> 00:20:44,576
- I went to so much trouble... for a guy...
- Huh?

314
00:20:46,912 --> 00:20:48,247
An all-boys school?

315
00:20:48,330 --> 00:20:52,709
Yeah. I went to an all-boys school
before. Didn't I tell you that?

316
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:56,088
That's news to me.
Wow I had no idea at all.

317
00:20:57,005 --> 00:20:58,507
You had no idea? I'm offended!

318
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:01,843
I'm just a normal boy who
likes to dress up, that's all!

319
00:21:01,927 --> 00:21:05,013
Since nobody asked,
I just assumed you all knew.

320
00:21:05,722 --> 00:21:07,182
Seriously? How could we have known?!

321
00:21:07,266 --> 00:21:09,559
You should have told us yourself as well!

322
00:21:09,643 --> 00:21:13,063
Don't get mad at me!
After all, you and I are kindred spirits!

323
00:21:13,563 --> 00:21:16,650
- After all, you and I are kindred spirits!
- Kindred spirits...

324
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:20,612
We're not kindred spirits
because I'm not into that at all!

325
00:21:28,078 --> 00:21:30,706
And now I charge!

